      "code": "code = pcre2_compile((PCRE2_SPTR)data, (PCRE2_SIZE)size, compile_options,\n  &errorcode, &erroroffset, NULL);",
      "note": "The harness forwards the exact staged witness bytes into the PCRE2 compiler. Compilation succeeds in the reproduced run because execution later reaches `pcre2_match_8` and the crashing `match()` epilogue.",
